  EntryData:
    entries:
    - name: Prisoner
      icon: {fileID: -252671194, guid: c9f5870882a2f3642a3d072d9cb86e4d, type: 3}
      dialogueStrips:
      - "Help us! We\u2019ve done nothing wrong!"
    - name: Green Pin 1
      icon: {fileID: 1842954740, guid: c9f5870882a2f3642a3d072d9cb86e4d, type: 3}
      dialogueStrips:
      - Shut it, bluey!
      - "\u2026"
      - What are you looking at? Mind your own business, false prophet!
    - name: Green Pin 2
      icon: {fileID: 1842954740, guid: c9f5870882a2f3642a3d072d9cb86e4d, type: 3}
      dialogueStrips:
      - Easy now, this one could be useful.
      - Do you want to see this filth get freed?
      - "Tell you what, you bring us something we need, and we\u2019ll make it worth
        your while."
      - "A little boost for you\u2026 and maybe we let these pieces of garbage go."
      - Whadda you say?
